      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْفَرَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A broom; a thing with which one
sweeps;</i> (S, M, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْفَرٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْفِيرَةٌ</span></b> ,
of which last, (expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا يُسْفَرُ بِهِ</span>,) the pl. is
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسَافِيرُ</span>. (TA.)

